// G2 NO-RESET PROOF.
//
// Connect, halt, read the board identity while halted, resume. Nothing else.
// No reset command appears here and none may be added: this is the exact
// sequence that will later be pointed at a board whose .noinit IS the evidence.
//
// The halt is safe with respect to the watchdog: wdt_setup() passes
// WDT_OPT_PAUSE_HALTED_BY_DBG (B306_Part/firmware/src/main.c), so the WDT is
// paused while the debugger holds the core. Re-verify that line before every
// campaign -- if it ever changes, a halt longer than WATCHDOG_TIMEOUT_MS
// (30 s) becomes a reset, and a reset is the one thing this step exists to
// prevent.
si 1
speed 4000
device NRF52840_XXAA
connect
halt
mem32 0x10000060, 2
regs
go
exit
